---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import DraftBanner from '../components/DraftBanner.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy | Kumar Ashutosh"
  description="Draft privacy notice: what this site collects today, and what it plans to collect if a newsletter, Google Analytics or ads are added."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container page-narrow legal">
    <DraftBanner />
    <p class="section-tag">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="section-title">Privacy</h1>

    <h2>What happens today</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>This site does not set cookies of its own and has no sign-up, comment or login features.</li>
      <li>It uses Plausible Analytics for aggregate visit statistics. Plausible documents that it does not use cookies.</li>
      <li>Links to Calendly, LinkedIn and GitHub leave this site. Those services have their own privacy policies.</li>
      <li>There is no newsletter yet. You can follow new writing through the <a class="text-link" href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Planned: newsletter</h2>
    <p>Not active today. If a newsletter is added, this is how signup data would be handled.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Data collected: your email address, the time you signed up and which page you signed up from (source).</li>
      <li>Processors: Resend would send the emails and Cloudflare would run the signup service.</li>
      <li>Retention: kept until you unsubscribe, then removed.</li>
      <li>Deletion: ask for your data to be deleted through the <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Planned: Google Analytics 4 and advertising</h2>
    <p>Not active today. Google Analytics 4 and Google AdSense may be added later. If so, this page and the <a class="text-link" href="/cookies/">cookies page</a> would be updated first.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>Use the <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
